@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@adminKey = <set-a-private-local-key>
@traceId = <trace-uuid>
@runId = <run-uuid>
@releaseId = <release-id>
@stageIdempotencyKey = <unique-idempotency-key>
@evaluateIdempotencyKey = <unique-idempotency-key>

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ready

### Find a trace and its spans
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/traces/{{traceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Read recent audit records
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Create a scoped API key (response contains the raw key once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "local-test",
  "scopes": ["admin:read"]
}

### Revoke an API key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/api-keys/<api-key-uuid>
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Read-only ETL preview
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/etl/runs?source=crawl_md&mode=dry_run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./path/to/approved-crawl-bundle.zip

### Stage into the development draft
# Requires explicit owner approval. The ZIP must contain the approved crawl and both website JSON files.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/etl/runs?source=crawl_md&mode=stage
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{stageIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./path/to/approved-crawl-bundle.zip

### List and inspect ETL runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/etl/runs?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/etl/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### List releases and inspect the current draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/releases
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/releases/current-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Compare and evaluate a release
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/releases/{{releaseId}}/diff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/releases/{{releaseId}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{evaluateIdempotencyKey}}

### Reload the active published snapshot after an approved publish
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/snapshot/reload
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Publish is intentionally blocked until Phase 3 search evaluation is available
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/releases/{{releaseId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
